/*!
    \page crlf-line-continuation.html
    \title CRLF line continuation
    \brief Exercises getRestOfLine() line continuation on CRLF sources.

    This page is authored with Windows (CRLF) line endings. The image alt
    text below ends a physical line with a continuation backslash and is
    then followed by a blank line before the continued text. On CRLF
    sources the carriage return sitting before the newline used to be
    folded into the scanned text, which dropped the leading words of the
    argument. QDoc must join the argument identically to a Unix-line-ending
    source.

    \image sample.png head part of the alt text \

    tail part of the alt text.
*/
